@title bandproduct92 — one source gate c ^= a | !b through the product-share Gray fold
@subtitle The replicated per-gate body only: Gray fold V = C ⊕ M(B) ⊕ κ, 2 value relocations (rg_freq), mask re-source, band roll.  Cost is a seeded draw ≈ 92 on average — the '92' in the name; seed 10 was chosen so this instance draws the average (92 at n=8).  The one-time mask injection (cleartext→encoded input) and the final strip/route-home (decoding) are fixed infrastructure and are NOT shown — injection is still run so the fold draws against a stocked ledger.
@equation c' = c ⊕ (a ∨ ¬b)  via  V = C ⊕ M(B) ⊕ κ  (Gray fold)
